<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Registered Sale Deed Document Extract — Survey 142/3C</title>
  <style>
    body { font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif; background: #0f172a; color: #f8fafc; padding: 40px; }
    .card { background: #1e293b; border: 1px solid #334155; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px; border-radius: 16px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5); }
    h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #f59e0b; border-bottom: 2px solid #334155; padding-bottom: 12px; margin-top: 0; font-family: monospace; }
    .field { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 14px; display: flex; justify-space-between; }
    .label { color: #94a3b8; font-weight: bold; width: 220px; display: inline-block; }
    .value { color: #f8fafc; font-weight: bold; font-family: monospace; }
    .highlight { color: #f59e0b; background: rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.15); padding: 2px 6px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.3); }
    .stamp { margin-top: 30px; border-top: 1px dashed #475569; pt-15px; text-align: center; color: #10b981; font-size: 12px; font-weight: bold; letter-spacing: 1px; }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <h1>REGISTERED SALE DEED EXTRACT (DOCUMENT EVIDENTIARY SUBMISSION)</h1>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Document Registration No:</span><span class="value">SD/2024/99128</span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Registered Owner Name:</span><span class="value">K. Kumar</span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Jurisdiction Village:</span><span class="value">Kaveri Village (Ambattur Taluk, Chennai District)</span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Target Survey Identifier:</span><span class="value highlight">142/3C</span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Reference Government Patta:</span><span class="value">PT-10245 (Reference: 142/3B)</span></div>
    <div class="field"><span class="label">Parcel Extent Stated:</span><span class="value">1.25 Acres (Nanjai Wetland)</span></div>
    <div class="stamp">✓ OFFICIAL EVIDENCE RECORD — SUBMITTED TO LANDLENS VERIFICATION LAYER</div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
